ced in the household trash.\n* Check your local municipal waste rules first, as some areas strictly prohibit this.\n* If permitted, wrap the pet securely in paper or a small cloth, place it inside a sealed plastic bag, and place it in the outdoor trash bin immediately before collection day.\n\n---\n\n### Sanitation Note\n* Always wear gloves or use a clean cloth/paper towel when handling the remains.\n* Thoroughly wash and disinfect your hands, surfaces, and the hamster's cage afterward.",
